directly or indirectly operate a competing business, inspection-related or otherwise, through any individual, entity, or affiliate during the Term;
fail to disclose or attempt to divert revenue through related parties, subsidiaries, or contractors to avoid royalty obligations;
offer, schedule, sell, or fulfill any Approved Products and Services through any business entity or trade name other than the WIN Business that is party to this Franchise Agreement;
fail to maintain and use a single designated business bank account for all customer payments and all EFT withdrawals for fees owed to us, as required in Item 6;
