(C) transferee is approved by us; 
(D) transferee signs our then-current franchise agreement, which may have terms that are materially different than the terms in your Franchise Agreement; 
(E) Intentionally left blank; 
(F) if necessary, you have received the landlord consent to transfer any lease of Approved Location to transferee; 
(G) Intentionally left blank; 
